<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output slides 74 pct in January.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output slides 74 pct in January.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in January fell 74.0 percent from December but was 5.7-percent higher than in January 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said 3,764 dwellings were completed in January.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	  JANUARY   DECEMBER    JAN '96</p>
<p> month/month pct change	 -74.0	128.7	 -76.2</p>
<p> number of dwellings built    3,764     11,776	 3,586</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
